# Scoped whitespace rules for measured logs committed as-is.
#
# The instruments (install-from-git.mjs, the A1/joint kits) append "\n" to text
# that already ends in "\n", so text transcripts end with one blank line at EOF;
# one driver.log line interpolates an empty field and therefore ends in a space.
# These are measured bytes, not formatting: re-writing them would make the
# committed transcript differ from what the run produced. Only the whitespace
# rules those two facts need are disabled, and only for this evidence directory.
* whitespace=-blank-at-eof
*.log whitespace=-blank-at-eof,-trailing-space
